title: 共产党来查问我们在实现联盟目标上的进展……
view-if: (in_popular_front or in_left_front) and (kpd_ultimatum_timer = 0 or (welfare_goal_completed and agriculture_goal_completed and economy_goal_completed and finance_goal_completed and labor_goal_completed and reichswehr_goal_completed)) and kpd_goals_seen = 1 and kpd_ultimatum_seen = 0 and spd_in_government
on-arrival: {!
Q.kpd_ultimatum_seen = 1;
Q.kpd_goals_completed = 1;
Q.kpd_score = 6;
if (Q.welfare_goal && !Q.welfare_goal_completed) {
    Q.kpd_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.kpd_score -= 1;
}
if (Q.agriculture_goal && !Q.agriculture_goal_completed) {
    Q.kpd_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.kpd_score -= 1;
}
if (Q.economy_goal && !Q.economy_goal_completed) {
    Q.kpd_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.kpd_score -= 1;
}
if (Q.finance_goal && !Q.finance_goal_completed) {
    Q.kpd_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.kpd_score -= 1;
}
if (Q.labor_goal && !Q.labor_goal_completed) {
    Q.kpd_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.kpd_score -= 1;
}
if (Q.foreign_goal && !Q.foreign_goal_completed) {
    Q.kpd_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.kpd_score -= 1;
}
if (Q.interior_goal && !Q.interior_goal_completed) {
    Q.kpd_goals_completed = 0;
}
if (Q.reichswehr_goal && !Q.reichswehr_goal_completed) {
    Q.kpd_goals_completed = 0;
    Q.kpd_score -= 1;
}
!}
new-page: true
tags: event
go-to: goals_success if kpd_goals_completed; goals_failed if not kpd_goals_completed

= 共产党的目标

在本届政府成立之初,共产党提出了它对联盟的目标清单:

[? if welfare_goal = 1 : - 扩大社会福利计划 - [? if welfare_goal_completed : 成功 ?][? if not welfare_goal_completed: 失败 ?] ?]

[? if agriculture_goal = 1 : - 推行土地改革计划。 - [? if agriculture_goal_completed : 成功 ?][? if not agriculture_goal_completed: 失败 ?] ?]

[? if economy_goal = 1 : - 着手对经济进行大规模国有化。 - [? if economy_goal_completed : 成功 ?][? if not economy_goal_completed: 失败 ?] ?]

[? if finance_goal = 1 : - 让税制更具累进性。 - [? if finance_goal_completed : 成功 ?][? if not finance_goal_completed: 失败 ?] ?]

[? if labor_goal = 1 : - 在劳资纠纷中支持工人。 - [? if labor_goal_completed : 成功 ?][? if not labor_goal_completed: 失败 ?] ?]

[? if foreign_goal = 1 : - 改善我们与苏联的关系。 - [? if foreign_goal_completed : 成功 ?][? if not foreign_goal_completed: 失败 ?] ?]

[? if reichswehr_goal = 1 : - 削减国防军的经费。 - [? if reichswehr_goal_completed : 成功 ?][? if not reichswehr_goal_completed: 失败 ?] ?]

@goals_failed
on-arrival: kpd_relation -= 10; workers_spd -= 8; unemployed_spd -= 8;

遗憾的是,我们未能实现共产党设定的全部目标。他们打算对我们的政府提出不信任案,并已开始发动宣传攻势,在工人眼中削弱我们政府的合法性。

- @appeal: 恳请共产党人耐心一些 —— 我们正在努力!
- @kpd_vote_of_no_confidence.support_center: 我们能否以中央党与 [+ ddp_name +](或许还有人民党)为基础组建一个新政府?
- @kpd_vote_of_no_confidence.let_it_happen: 让投票进行吧。
- @no_vonc: 由于宪法改革,他们无法提出不信任案,但他们可以在每一个机会上阻挠我们的政府。

@appeal
choose-if: (kpd_score >= 4 and kpd_relation > 50 and kpd_appeal_seen = 0) or kpd_party_leader = "Conciliators"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if kpd_score < 4: 他们不认为我们在认真争取实现联盟的目标。 ?] [? if kpd_relation < 50: 我们的关系太差。 ?] [? if kpd_appeal_seen = 1: 我们没有更多时间了。 ?]
on-arrival: kpd_ultimatum_seen = 0; kpd_ultimatum_timer += 6; kpd_appeal_seen = 1

我们辩称正努力实现联盟的大部分目标,并且为了无产阶级团结,我们必须让这个联盟运转起来。出乎意料,共产党听取了我们的陈情,愿意再给我们六个月时间去达成联盟目标。


@goals_success
on-arrival: workers_spd += 8; unemployed_spd += 8; kpd_relation += 10; workers_kpd += 5; kpd_coalition_success += 1
go-to: popular_front_achievement if in_popular_front; united_front_achievement if in_left_front

出乎所有人的预料,共产党的目标全部实现了!显然,共产党人并未为这种可能做准备 —— 一个通过民主手段成功建立的工人政府。在本届任期的余下时间里,他们将继续「容忍」我们的政府,同时仍充当监督资产阶级倒退的看门狗。


@popular_front_achievement
on-arrival: popular_front_success += 1
achievement: volksfront_2

@united_front_achievement
on-arrival: united_front_success += 1
achievement: einheitsfront_2

@no_vonc
view-if: constructive_vonc
on-arrival: in_popular_front = 0; in_left_front = 0; in_minority_government = 1;

我们实际上已被变成一个少数派政府,共产党打算阻挠我们通过任何政策。
